 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. LISTD.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01  REC.
     05  R-A   PIC X(3).
     05  R-B   PIC X(3).
 77  W77   PIC X(4) VALUE "SEVN".
 01  DT    PIC X(6) VALUE "261108".
 01  DT-R REDEFINES DT.
     05  DT-YY PIC XX.
     05  DT-MM PIC XX.
     05  DT-DD PIC XX.
 01  NEG   PIC S9(3) VALUE -5.
 01  POS   PIC 9(3) VALUE +7.
 01  ISV   PIC 9(3) VALUE IS 9.
 01  FLAG  PIC X VALUE " ".
     88  FLAG-OFF VALUE SPACES.
 01  CNT   PIC 9(3) VALUE ZERO.
     88  CNT-NONE VALUE ZERO.
 01  LAST  PIC X(4) VALUE "END!".
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
 MAIN-PARA.
     MOVE "ABCDEF" TO REC.
     DISPLAY "A9 " REC "/" W77.
     DISPLAY "A11 " DT-MM "/" DT-DD.
     MOVE "991231" TO DT.
     DISPLAY "A11B " DT-YY " " LAST.
     DISPLAY "A12 " POS " " ISV.
     IF NEG < 0 DISPLAY "A12N OK" ELSE DISPLAY "A12N FAIL".
     IF FLAG-OFF DISPLAY "A12B OK" ELSE DISPLAY "A12B FAIL".
     IF CNT-NONE DISPLAY "A12C OK" ELSE DISPLAY "A12C FAIL".
     STOP RUN.
